Create a next.js landing page for a Vietnam Airlines Technical Department Pickleball club. 
The landing page provides following information to its users:
-	Information related to the tournaments played: name of the event, location, date, photos, results.
-	Information related to the upcoming tournaments: name of the event, location, date.
-	Ranking of the players based on their performance at each event.
-	Tips to play pickleball better.
The layout of the landing page:
-	On the top, right: button for Admin to access (with user/password) to edit, modify, update the landing page. Only Admin can do editing of the page;
-	On the center, left: photos of the last events (5 photos, each appear 5 seconds);
-	Below is the list of the upcoming events;
-	On the right: ranking of the players. Add a link to explain the rule of ranking
-	The theme of the landing page reflects branding of Vietnam Airlines (colors, lotus logo)
Page for Admin include:
-	Create new event. App can suggest the pairing of players based on their ranking;
-	Add/delete/modify players
Rule of players’ ranking:
-	Each win: + 100 points;
-	Champion of the event: + 300 points;
-	1st Runner up: + 100 points;
-	Semi-finalists: + 200 points;
-	Quarter- finalists: + 100 points.
Database use: Firebase
Authentification: Supabase
Steps:
-	Create a plan -> create implementation plan -> create layout -> build app.
-	Each step needs approval before proceeding to the next.
